   - Use only ids from the list. Never invent a place.
   - If the traveller chose a hub, use it. Otherwise pick the hub that suits them best.
   - Return 10 to 15 picks from that hub, best first. Restaurants count; day trips (marked "day trip") are fine if they fit the traveller.
